NegroniMetal change to ios-flame 745c434 phone/metal2 (on top of flame/0001-0016) for metal2vulkan 219f013:
- MetalLevel and DeviceOptions::metal_level are gone upstream (ec72c05: one macOS release, 27.0.1, on every host): drop both uses.
- negroni_policy(): ColorWritesPolicy / Unorm8LinearFilterPolicy and their DevicePolicy fields are gone (native-arithmetic round); exact = exact_answers(), compositor = default.

